{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dwarf Eats Mountain is a simple strategic incremental game about mining mountains with dwarves and their war machines.</strong> Harvest gold and artifacts, then use those riches to upgrade and grow your dwarven empire \u2014 so you can devour even bigger mountains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/45de6cbb696ef05416386d7b7874d7a7.poster.avif?t=1767469533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/45de6cbb696ef05416386d7b7874d7a7.webm?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/45de6cbb696ef05416386d7b7874d7a7.mp4?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire a diverse army of dwarves and deploy mighty artillery, each mastering unique methods of carving mountains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From trusty pickaxes and dynamite throwers, to colossal ballistae, flamers and laser cannons. Plus scientists, runesmiths, alelords and spelunkers, all working together to maximize extraction. Each unit boasts a deep upgrade tree for specializing in different styles of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9bfdb1c9cb2d5aca6486dde3281103cf.poster.avif?t=1767469533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9bfdb1c9cb2d5aca6486dde3281103cf.webm?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9bfdb1c9cb2d5aca6486dde3281103cf.mp4?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, hurting the mountain physically (and emotionally) is only half the battle, as <strong>the glittering gold it produces must also be brought back to your stash.</strong> Indeed, this is the perilous and noble job of the Runners, who dance amongst the falling rocks, risking their beards to retrieve riches for the Great Maw!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/25bb043b29e4b4573ffff91d4ba01599.poster.avif?t=1767469533\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/25bb043b29e4b4573ffff91d4ba01599.webm?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/25bb043b29e4b4573ffff91d4ba01599.mp4?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware as the Great Mother won't let go of her shiny children easily. <strong>The more damage the dwarves cause to the mountain, the more the calamity bar grows</strong>, until it erupts and unleashes devastating disasters upon the wobbling beards below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Managing your gold production and retrieval, while making sure the sky doesn't fall on your head, will be a careful balancing act.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/5ca25f6bd3a63bf319188d44e4a64512.poster.avif?t=1767469533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/5ca25f6bd3a63bf319188d44e4a64512.webm?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/5ca25f6bd3a63bf319188d44e4a64512.mp4?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the dwarven ways of treasure extraction!</strong>  <br>This game is about making numbers go up, but the way you do that is open to your interpretation and ingenuity. At your fingertips:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different buildings and dwarves, each with various strengths and weaknesses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abundance of upgrades and active rituals to enhance and buff dwarves and their machines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ ancient Artifacts to collect and display in your gallery, each with special effects which complement and adapt your build - Can you collect them all?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare resources such as the coveted Mithril and the mountain's Soul, presenting decisions whether to spend them on weapon upgrades, forging artifacts, or casting powerful enchantments and rituals</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige to replay the game while progressing faster, with new synergistic build-defining effects (65+ prestige upgrades)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what the gods have hidden in the world spire, and what happened to the previous civilizations when they dug too deep</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/5fe66bc04718866285fef17b5ab2a4e2.poster.avif?t=1767469533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/5fe66bc04718866285fef17b5ab2a4e2.webm?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/5fe66bc04718866285fef17b5ab2a4e2.mp4?t=1767469533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078200?t=1767469533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078200?t=1767469533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/e2441b8799086d49969ea2a8c4cbe612f88ddd30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767469533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/e2441b8799086d49969ea2a8c4cbe612f88ddd30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767469533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dwarf Eats Mountain is a simple strategic incremental game about mining mountains with dwarves and their war machines.</strong> Harvest gold and artifacts, then use those riches to upgrade and grow your dwarven empire \u2014 so you can devour even bigger mountains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/45de6cbb696ef05416386d7b7874d7a7.poster.avif?t=1767469533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40782